              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea maygut gang'ula heeda wagiida was gadiyeeda geatinga nyaawa nea maygut gang'ula gadiyeeda sina geatinga nyaawa was sanaamu bea aseecheeka siguura Asheri ghana heeda wagiida siing'andiit.",
